            "body": "Thanks for the issue!\n\nThis works as expected. Plain duplicating a line tells explorer to create two different file system entries that have the same name, which is impossible.\n\nThe approach that works is to `yyp` (or `gmm` with 'mini.operators') and then rename a new line.",
